Probably.

3175
02:58:51,160 --> 02:58:52,320
Lathered in oil.

3176
02:58:53,600 --> 02:58:55,520
And I would flop around like a seal, you know?

3177
02:58:55,620 --> 02:58:56,280
Making noises.

3178
