No matter what, I cannot call this one a failure.

3185
02:59:20,010 --> 02:59:21,110
We came out on top.

3186
02:59:26,910 --> 02:59:28,130
What a beautiful day it is.

3187
02:59:28,170 --> 02:59:28,550
Look at that.

3188
02:59:29,270 --> 02:59:30,430
The sun is shining.

3189
02:59:30,870 --> 02:59:32,130
The cows are mooing.

3190
02:59:32,290 --> 02:59:33,350
The bees are whispering.

3191
02:59:34,530 --> 02:59:36,590
Wait, if cows moo, what do bees do?

3192
02:59:37,150 --> 02:59:37,850
Think about it.

3193
02:59:38,970 --> 02:59:41,570
Nobody has ever asked these fundamental questions before.

3194
02:59:41,990 --> 02:59:44,490
But I feel like it's essential that we get to the bottom of it.

3195
02:59:44,950 --> 02:59:45,390
Right?

3196
02:59:46,150 --> 02:59:48,230
I don't think humanity has an answer to this.

3197
02:59:49,390 --> 02:59:50,830
This needs to be investigated.

3198
02:59:51,450 --> 02:59:52,490
By top people.

3199
02:59:53,870 --> 02:59:56,310
There's probably top people on this as we speak.

3200
