I mean, I'm not trying to reference that song.

3209
03:00:21,860 --> 03:00:25,060
I mean, obviously, that's, you know, a thing, but...

3210
03:00:25,060 --> 03:00:26,440
There's no word for the fox.

3211
03:00:28,120 --> 03:00:28,860
There isn't.

3212
03:00:29,740 --> 03:00:31,040
The fox is in the bees.

3213
03:00:36,340 --> 03:00:37,340
Where's my boat?

3214
03:00:37,740 --> 03:00:38,200
There it is.

3215
