It wouldn't surprise me if that noise was also made by a human.

3216
03:00:50,050 --> 03:00:51,170
That's not a real sheep.

3217
03:00:51,370 --> 03:00:52,950
That's Notch making that noise.

3218
03:00:53,970 --> 03:00:54,810
