3219
03:00:56,150 --> 03:00:57,870
That's something a Swedish person would do.

3220
03:00:57,950 --> 03:00:58,610
I just know it.

3221
03:01:00,010 --> 03:01:01,530
Classic Swedish person behavior.

3222
03:01:04,030 --> 03:01:06,290
Also, am I actually already on the right island?

3223
03:01:07,750 --> 03:01:10,210
I got a little disoriented on my way here.

3224
03:01:10,210 --> 03:01:11,470
because I was so happy.

3225
03:01:11,830 --> 03:01:12,890
I didn't pay attention.

3226
03:01:18,850 --> 03:01:21,090
No, I think I had to go in the water once more.

3227
03:01:22,470 --> 03:01:22,910
Yep.

3228
03:01:23,210 --> 03:01:24,450
I remember this spot here.

3229
03:01:25,050 --> 03:01:27,390
We had a forest fire that we tried to take out, remember?

3230
03:01:29,390 --> 03:01:30,310
Successfully, I might add.

3231
03:01:31,610 --> 03:01:32,770
Although it wasn't easy.

3232
03:01:33,910 --> 03:01:34,350
Fire.

3233
03:01:34,630 --> 03:01:36,370
It turns out it's spreading fast.

3234
03:01:37,170 --> 03:01:38,990
When there's flammable materials around.

3235
03:01:42,290 --> 03:01:43,490
By the way, isn't it soon...

3236
03:01:44,270 --> 03:01:44,970
Wait a minute.

3237
03:01:45,170 --> 03:01:46,510
It's Halloween soon.

3238
03:01:46,590 --> 03:01:46,870
Isn't it?

3239
