September, October, November.

3243
03:01:53,670 --> 03:01:53,810
Yeah.

3244
03:01:54,470 --> 03:01:55,050
It's gotta be October.

3245
03:01:57,590 --> 03:02:00,570
I was just thinking about that when I saw those mushrooms on the way here.

3246
03:02:00,770 --> 03:02:00,870
No.

3247
03:02:03,010 --> 03:02:03,770
Orange rooms.

3248
03:02:04,130 --> 03:02:04,630
You know what I mean.

3249
03:02:05,490 --> 03:02:06,750
The orange things, man.

3250
03:02:07,910 --> 03:02:10,710
The ones you chop and cut to make faces out of.

3251
03:02:11,990 --> 03:02:16,870
I think this year I may actually do that in real life, you know?

3252
03:02:17,870 --> 03:02:21,210
I used to do that with my ex, but I kinda stopped doing it when I broke up with her.

3253
03:02:23,590 --> 03:02:25,730
But maybe I'll do it this time around by myself.

3254
03:02:25,850 --> 03:02:29,310
I'm just gonna sit next to Jackie and we're gonna cut faces into, uh...

3255
03:02:29,310 --> 03:02:29,890
orange rooms.

3256
