Is it worth it, though?

3258
03:02:35,970 --> 03:02:36,290
Hold on.

3259
03:02:37,030 --> 03:02:38,850
Efficiency 3 is kinda bad anyway.

3260
03:02:39,990 --> 03:02:41,130
Dude, we make a new one.

3261
03:02:42,430 --> 03:02:43,530
Let's see what we can make.

3262
03:02:46,270 --> 03:02:47,030
Not that one.

3263
03:02:48,730 --> 03:02:49,170
Okay!

3264
03:02:50,090 --> 03:02:51,550
I don't mind that!

3265
03:02:51,670 --> 03:02:52,270
That's pretty good.

3266
03:02:52,610 --> 03:02:53,090
Fortune 2.

3267
03:02:56,610 --> 03:02:57,470
Hold on a second.

3268
03:02:59,310 --> 03:03:01,350
Also, um...

3269
03:03:02,270 --> 03:03:03,450
I need more bookcases.

3270
03:03:05,510 --> 03:03:08,330
And I do have lots of books.

3271
03:03:08,330 --> 03:03:08,750
Look at that.

3272
03:03:10,350 --> 03:03:11,270
And beef.

3273
03:03:11,470 --> 03:03:12,010
Let's cook it.

3274
03:03:13,050 --> 03:03:13,930
I'm so excited.

3275
03:03:14,250 --> 03:03:14,730
We're gonna...

3276
03:03:14,730 --> 03:03:17,130
Oh, we cannot blast it, but we can definitely smoke it.

3277
03:03:19,330 --> 03:03:20,330
We also have a...

3278
03:03:20,330 --> 03:03:20,830
Oh, man.

3279
03:03:20,990 --> 03:03:22,450
