3280
03:03:22,750 --> 03:03:23,610
Oh, it's fantastic.

3281
03:03:24,250 --> 03:03:25,210
That's so nice.

3282
03:03:26,070 --> 03:03:27,350
This one is back, too.

3283
03:03:28,830 --> 03:03:29,350
Uh...

3284
03:03:29,350 --> 03:03:30,490
Shovel is back.

3285
03:03:31,610 --> 03:03:32,650
This one goes in here.

3286
03:03:33,270 --> 03:03:35,030
All these arrows, we don't really need them right now.

3287
03:03:37,350 --> 03:03:38,090
Or this one.

3288
03:03:38,850 --> 03:03:39,790
Do need that one.

3289
03:03:41,170 --> 03:03:42,710
Ah, I need to make a good bow, too.

3290
03:03:44,790 --> 03:03:46,290
What I have right now is not enough.

3291
03:03:49,360 --> 03:03:51,200
Oh, by the way, uh...

3292
03:03:51,200 --> 03:03:56,320
One of the reasons I wanted to go there was to find new materials like the endstone to see if we could make new stuff out of it.

3293
03:03:57,680 --> 03:03:58,120
Um...

3294
03:03:58,120 --> 03:03:59,880
But I didn't really focus on that this time around.

3295
03:04:00,260 --> 03:04:03,540
I'll probably go back and grab all kinds of stuff.

3296
03:04:03,660 --> 03:04:05,880
Especially from uh...

3297
03:04:05,880 --> 03:04:07,980
The end where you find those cities, right?

3298
03:04:08,320 --> 03:04:09,500
I wanna grab all this...

3299
03:04:09,500 --> 03:04:10,040
Like, uh...

3300
03:04:10,040 --> 03:04:11,040
Shulkers and all that.

3301
03:04:11,360 --> 03:04:12,380
No, not Shulker.

3302
03:04:13,000 --> 03:04:14,240
Oh, what's the word?

3303
03:04:15,340 --> 03:04:15,940
Is it...

3304
