No, Skulk?

3305
03:04:16,820 --> 03:04:18,040
I forgot which one is which.

3306
03:04:18,160 --> 03:04:21,540
But you know the ones where you can make the little spinny chests?

3307
03:04:22,200 --> 03:04:22,680
That's...

3308
03:04:22,680 --> 03:04:23,100
That's what I want.

3309
03:04:24,620 --> 03:04:26,980
That material is what I want.

3310
03:04:27,240 --> 03:04:27,880
I want it.

3311
03:04:29,960 --> 03:04:30,440
Oaks!

3312
03:04:30,820 --> 03:04:32,220
Uh, we also don't need an extra shield.

3313
03:04:32,280 --> 03:04:34,380
In fact, get the shield off of me.

3314
03:04:36,360 --> 03:04:38,220
Its shadow is blocking my toilet.

3315
03:04:39,540 --> 03:04:40,900
I have two spy glasses.

3316
03:04:44,280 --> 03:04:44,760
Uh...

3317
03:04:44,760 --> 03:04:45,000
Right.

3318
03:04:45,080 --> 03:04:46,400
I wanted to make bookcases.

3319
03:04:46,680 --> 03:04:47,220
Let's do it.

3320
03:04:48,600 --> 03:04:50,100
Or, I guess, bookshelves.

3321
03:04:50,520 --> 03:04:51,280
Five of them?

3322
03:04:52,440 --> 03:04:53,480
Don't mind if I do.

3323
03:04:54,940 --> 03:04:55,420
Deep.

3324
03:04:55,740 --> 03:04:55,980
Deep.

3325
03:04:57,020 --> 03:04:57,500
Deep.

3326
03:04:57,760 --> 03:04:57,780
Deep.

3327
03:04:59,320 --> 03:04:59,800
Deep.

3328
03:05:04,790 --> 03:05:06,630
I mean, I like fortune too.

3329
03:05:06,770 --> 03:05:07,110
I do.

3330
03:05:09,630 --> 03:05:10,590
But, uh...

3331
03:05:10,590 --> 03:05:11,330
Hmm.

3332
03:05:13,130 --> 03:05:14,970
Let's see what else we can do before we do anything.

3333
03:05:15,430 --> 03:05:16,510
Maybe there's a better bow.

3334
03:05:19,110 --> 03:05:20,470
Always check everything, right?

3335
03:05:22,610 --> 03:05:23,090
Unbreaking?

3336
03:05:23,270 --> 03:05:24,030
I don't really care.

3337
03:05:24,550 --> 03:05:25,750
That one is not exciting.

3338
03:05:27,370 --> 03:05:28,930
Uh, let's check all these.

3339
03:05:29,430 --> 03:05:30,130
Uh, wait a minute.

3340
03:05:30,430 --> 03:05:32,150
